## 5. Rich-text formatting

```text
**Bold**
*Italic*
~~Strikethrough~~
<span underline="true">Underline</span>
`Inline code`
[Link text](https://example.com)
<span color="blue">Colored text</span>
Line one<br>Line two
```

Styles may be combined unless they conflict.
### 5.1 Inline code with a visual line break
Physical newlines are not permitted inside an inline-code span.

Use:

```text
`Line 1<br>Line 2`
```

### 5.2 Inline equation
Use ordinary dollar delimiters:

```text
$E = mc^2$
```

Do not wrap the equation in backticks.
### 5.3 Block equation

```text
$$
E = mc^2
$$
```

