## 8. Columns

```text
<columns>
	<column>
		### Goals
		- Goal one
		- Goal two
	</column>
	<column>
		### Non-goals
		- Non-goal one
		- Non-goal two
	</column>
</columns>
```

All blocks inside each column must be indented.

Use columns only when two or more sections benefit from direct visual comparison. Avoid placing long technical narratives or deeply nested content in columns.

