## 18. Agent preflight checklist
Before sending content to Notion, verify:

- [ ] Structural indentation uses tabs, not spaces.
- [ ] Every list item has text on its declaration line.
- [ ] No physical newline exists inside inline code.
- [ ] Inline equations use `$equation$`, not backtick-wrapped equations.
- [ ] Code, Mermaid, and equations are not escaped.
- [ ] Table cells contain rich text only.
- [ ] No undocumented table-width attributes are used.
- [ ] Unsupported `<embed>` syntax is not emitted.
- [ ] Mentions are used for references; child page/database blocks are used only structurally.
- [ ] Unknown blocks from fetched content are preserved.
- [ ] Meeting transcripts are not modified.
- [ ] A full replacement is not used when a targeted update is sufficient.
- [ ] The page is re-fetched or the returned markdown is inspected after mutation.

