## 19. Compact valid example

````text
# Async Extraction API

<callout icon="📌" color="blue_bg">
	**Document type:** Story
	**Status:** Ready for implementation
</callout>

<table_of_contents color="gray"/>
## Summary
Add an asynchronous execution path to `POST /extract` while preserving synchronous behavior by default.
## Acceptance criteria
- [ ] `?wait=false` returns `202 Accepted`.
- [ ] The response includes `job_id`, `status_url`, and `status`.
- [ ] `GET /jobs/{job_id}` requires authentication.
- [ ] Unknown jobs return `404`.
## Flow

```mermaid
flowchart TD
	A["Client"] --> B["POST /extract?wait=false"]
	B --> C["Job store"]
	C --> D["Worker"]
	D --> E["GET /jobs/{job_id}"]
```

## Key decision
<callout icon="🏛️" color="purple_bg">
	Use an in-process LRU store for the initial single-instance deployment.
</callout>
## Risk
> Job state is lost when the process restarts. {color="yellow"}
````

