## 20. Source-of-truth policy
This guide is an operational profile for BMAD document generation, not a replacement for the official Notion specification.
When this guide conflicts with:

1. the live Notion MCP resource,
2. the current official enhanced-markdown documentation, or
3. the active MCP tool schema,
the live official source takes precedence.

Revalidate this guide after major Notion MCP or API-version changes.